{"time": "20261117T173041Z", "think": "Take the stone.", "command": "take Seal-Stone of the Kings", "result": "Added: Seal-Stone of the Kings\n\n*** Quest complete: The Deepest Hall ***\nJournal: I took the third seal-stone from the vault of Vorannuhl. I now carry all three seal-stones. Never-Writes-Twice ordered all three brought to her before anyone goes near the gate. I'm to bring them to her in Nesh-Deeka's House in Helstrom.\n\nThe game pauses. Answer these four questions from what the game has shown you, in your own words, numbered, in one command: answer '1. ... 2. ... 3. ... 4. ...'\n1. What is going on? (who you work for, what has happened, why it matters, as far as you know)\n2. What are you expected to do next, and where?\n3. What options do you have for doing it? (the ways through you can see, and any choice in front of you)\n4. Is there any word, name, person or thing you do not understand? Do you know how you could find out?", "summary": {"stage": 93, "at": "Vault of the Household", "items": {"item.lockpick": 2, "thing.mn.unbound-note": 1, "item.mn05.voh-vastei-armour": 1, "thing.mn.eye-setting": 1, "thing.mn.keystone": 1, "thing.mn.grave-stake": 1, "thing.mn.paralysis-poison": 3, "thing.mn.bronze-disc": 1, "thing.mn.parchment-map": 1, "thing.mn10.rapier": 1, "thing.mn12.sap-jar": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-cuirass": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-helm": 1, "thing.mn.seal-stone-thief": 1, "thing.mn.seal-stone-vault": 1, "thing.mn16.bronze-key": 1, "thing.mn.seal-stone-deep": 1}, "gold": 1650, "flags": {"flag.mn03.truth": true, "flag.mn06.note-read": true, "flag.mn06.done": true, "flag.main.seal-question": true, "flag.main.rank-toh-wo": true, "flag.mn11.rubbing-read": true, "flag.mn11.done": true, "flag.mn12.trapdoor": true, "flag.mn12.door-tried": true, "flag.mn12.cellar-seen": true, "flag.mn13.archwarden-beds": true, "flag.mn13.done": true, "flag.mn14.inside-unseen": true}, "dead": ["npc.mn.hums-the-long-note", "npc.mn16.hesh-var", "npc.mn16.wraith-lord"], "heard":